{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X 的感受词在部分段落过于密集，相近的身体感受和情绪意象连续堆叠，尤其 S03、S07，容易让观众忙于读字而顾不上听音乐；Y 在左右分栏和快速扫读上更轻松。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的左右分栏更容易快速扫读，但它把不少音乐变化和情绪转折压缩成了概括性的感受词，观众容易知道他难受，却不一定明白他为什么在不同阶段反复动摇。X 更完整地呈现了从不再受气、怀念亲近、发现孤独，到不甘心回头、最终带着想念继续生活的因果链，而且把具体音乐变化与人物的身体感受、心理转折对应起来，细腻程度和整体叙事连贯性更好。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7b50051f-5d01-4757-ac79-ba7715bdc45e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T053600931175Z", "elapsed_seconds": 39.375, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:36:40.322598+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7299eda81f94a4bcdaf598028f64f381178b2ad9d9c502813082ec0303925809", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_we